@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:4000
@query = Football lovers in Washington DC in USA

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness (no secret values)
GET {{baseUrl}}/platforms
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### Validate intent and planned queries (no web search)
POST {{baseUrl}}/validate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: validate-example

{
  "query": "{{query}}"
}

### Required prospect discovery request
POST {{baseUrl}}/prospect-discovery
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: discovery-example

{
  "query": "{{query}}"
}

### Invalid request (must return 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/prospect-discovery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "ab"
}
